+// (int30 for the dot, int32 for the rest), the structured edge grid crossed with itself, and
+// n tails 0..9 and 1023 at every misalignment the main loop can leave. No clock, no files: a
+// counter records the comparisons. On aarch64 a build without the batch API is RED (the test
+// fails, it does not skip). Elsewhere the NEON path does not exist: the test prints SKIP by
+// name, and a SKIP is not a pass.
